{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01A7fnnP6NP61wo2THsEfTCN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Written and committed **Q30: Monitor autonomous agent behavior in production?**\n\nKey content in `answers/03-030-monitor-autonomous-agent-behavior-in-production.md`:\n\n- **Concept:** Three-layer approach — per-step structured traces, aggregate dashboards, anomaly alerts\n- **Mechanism:**\n  1. Step-level telemetry (run_id, step, tool, input/output, latency, tokens) → LangSmith / OpenTelemetry / Langfuse\n  2. Aggregate metrics dashboard: avg turns/run, tool error rate, p95 latency, cost/run, stuck-run rate\n  3. Alerts: loop detection via action fingerprint hashing (3 repeats → auto-terminate), cost spike (>2× rolling p95), circuit breaker on error cascade\n  4. Nightly golden dataset regression (50–100 canonical tasks, 5-point drift threshold)\n  5. User thumbs-up/down → RAGAS re-evaluation loop\n- **Concrete example:** E-commerce agent hitting 50K runs/day; loop bug (hallucinating new order IDs repeatedly) caught in 12 min via fingerprint alert — invisible in run-level logs\n- **Pitfalls:** Run-level logging only; reactive-only (no golden-set regression); treating cost as an afterthought"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":244,"cache_read_input_tokens":64587,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":244,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b188c18c-6012-4fe2-bae8-f6bb036df4b4","uuid":"b63a30e9-4e02-4af9-bbe2-37e74846180c"}
